Package: regdatasets
Title: Datasets for Teaching Regression Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-20
Authors@R:
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", , "jlee296@ua.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: Twenty-two datasets for teaching introductory and intermediate
    regression analysis in education and the social sciences: simple and
    multiple linear regression, ANOVA and ANCOVA, interactions, model
    building and diagnostics, logistic regression, latent-response and
    generalized linear models, and ordinal models. The data come from
    published studies, textbooks and public archives such as the National
    Education Longitudinal Study of 1988, the General Social Survey and PISA.
    Every dataset is rebuilt reproducibly from its source, cleaned of
    missing-value codes and documented variable by variable; list_datasets()
    and codebook() expose the metadata in R.
